WEBVTT

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:37.990
Falling into Shadow

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:51.550
A mistake that would cause all humans and beasts to die.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.710
A crime...

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:03.640
A child?

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.040
Hang in there!  I'll get you out right now!

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:08.760
I'll give you a hand!

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.360
You're fine.  I'll treat you right away.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.220
Someone!  The Queen's been injured!
Is there anyone who can help?!

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.970
The Queen is?!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.500
I can take care of her first aid.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.920
You're from Kazalm.  Please go to the Queen!

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:25.650
Someone!

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:27.080
But...

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:27.940
Anyone!

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.170
How could this be...

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:40.020
An army of Touda becomes nothing more than a pile of corpses before the jaws of a single beast-lord.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:45.470
Seeing this, I'm sure he'll...

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:52.210
When the Touda rammed into the ship,
she crashed hard into the wall.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:55.170
I tried to save her, but...

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:03.160
It may look fine right now, but there have been cases of internal bleeding inside the skull.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.210
I can't say much more without some observation time.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:11.100
We also need a doctor to look at her.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.130
I see.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.560
Damiya-sama!

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:22.080
He ran into the wall while trying to save the Queen.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.740
We'll be treating you.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:34.680
We've finished loading all the medicine and equipment.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:42.360
Yasa-sensei, please head on to Sir Kazalm's estate by horse and have him prepare a ship and doctors.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.290
I will.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.490
Rosa-sensei.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.570
Do you think the people on the Queen's ship will be all right?

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:53.460
They should be fine.  I'm sure Erin, Tomura, and the others are applying first aid.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.760
Erin...

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.730
What is this?  The pain just went away as though it had only been a joke.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:08.820
If you'll excuse me, I'll go to take care of the others.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.020
Can you <i>really</i> not do anything for Her Majesty?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:19.140
You have the Arryo's treasure that even creates miracles, don't you?

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:26.050
Damiya-sama, how is Her Majesty doing?

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.910
Kiriku-sensei.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:36.160
I'll take care of things here.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.400
You should work on cleaning yourself up.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.650
You left your overgrown baggage out there.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.960
Erin, you may go.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:03.780
Where's Ial-san?

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.360
He couldn't have!

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:32.680
Ial-san...

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.700
Ial-san.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.660
I'm glad to see you're fine.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.390
Did a Touda inflict that wound?

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.350
Don't worry.  I've done some preliminary treatment already.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.660
Touda fangs are poisonous.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.480
You'll have to neutralize it.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.810
Please wait here!  I'll go make the antidote.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.920
I will last.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.790
Treat my men first.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.410
Okay.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:29.220
Was he raised only to fight, just like Touda, and even now does he live only to think about fighting?

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:35.870
And like the Touda, will he never be able to free himself of that fate?

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.380
It doesn't have any crest.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:48.570
<i>He must be a soldier from two quarters away.</i>

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.030
<i>How can you tell?</i>

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:55.970
<i>The crest etched onto the Touda's hard scale is different from ours, right?</i>

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.490
That Touda doesn't have any crest!

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.300
Sir Kazalm's ships have arrived!

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:11.070
You didn't bring the shian antidote with you?

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:17.330
I'm sorry.  I didn't think anyone injured by Touda fangs would still be alive.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.310
I'll return to the school and get some.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.970
I can come back right away.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:25.930
Deliver the medicine to Sir Kazalm's estate.

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:27.720
We'll take the boats up the river.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:33.150
If the Grand Duke's Touda come to attack us again, we won't be able to hold them back here.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:35.850
The Grand Duke's Touda?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.580
You don't have to hurry.

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:44.040
Come to Sir Kazalm's estate on horseback.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.020
It would be better for you to leave your beast-lord behind.

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.480
Erin!  What's it like down there?

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:09.200
The Queen hit her head hard and still hasn't come to.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.390
What?!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.640
I...

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.960
I...

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:51.490
Erin had flown atop Lilan before so many people and swept an army of Touda to the waters below.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:57.860
Reviewing what she'd done, she could feel nothing but fear.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:16.840
The injured people were carried to Sir Kazalm's estate and the Queen was also being treated.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:24.560
Erin came to the estate with an antidote designed to work against Touda poisoning.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:31.420
Excuse me, I brought medicine with me.  Where might I find the Sezan Ial-sama?

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.470
Ial-dono is in the middle of a meeting.

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:38.490
"Meeting?"  In his condition?

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:43.020
He couldn't protect the Queen despite being a Sezan.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:47.450
He's in no position to be worrying about his own condition.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:55.880
Then please inform Ial-sama that I'm here when he finishes the meeting.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:59.740
I'll be treating those who are injured.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.590
Allow me to help.

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:07.960
Thank you.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.010
Grandmother's injured?!

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.210
Yes.

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:15.630
Oh, no...  What happened?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:19.070
I'm told her ship was attacked by Touda.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.530
Touda?!

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.090
Seimiya-sama!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:36.830
Ial!

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:42.840
You were in charge of protecting the Queen and yet you failed completely!

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:46.990
You're proving the Sezans to be useless!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:50.170
Aren't you guys supposed to be living shields?

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.770
Have you forgotten the purpose of your existence?

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:04.350
<i>No matter the sacrifice, it is part of the code to protect the Queen.</i>

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:10.440
<i>But Ial, this is my belief:</i>

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:16.520
<i>As long as those who do not try to see reality for what it is control this country,</i>

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:22.950
<i>we'll eventually become deficient at protecting the Queen.</i>

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:26.850
Screw being a shield!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.660
Ial!  Why don't you say something?!

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.590
We'll announce your disciplinary action later.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.310
You're dismissed.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.830
Touda... Touda!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:53.460
You're fine now.  The raid is over.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.530
Hold him down tightly.

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:07.870
Majesty!  Your Majesty!  Majesty!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.550
Ial-san.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.080
How are they doing?

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.630
We've finished treating them.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:34.270
I see.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.190
I've been waiting this whole time.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:47.340
Why didn't you come to me right away?

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:50.120
You should have known that I was here.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.080
I was occupied.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:00.860
With the poison having spread so much, your arm may not move again.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:09.720
It's your own body.  Why would you put off treating it until the end?

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.680
I'm sure your right arm is precious to you.

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:23.120
Do you plan upon willingly casting away what's precious to you?

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:46.610
This right arm was useless at a critical moment.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:57.520
I still haven't properly thanked you, have I?

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:01.420
Thanks to you, we all managed to survive.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.090
I'm very grateful.

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:12.940
No, I...

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:20.590
I hope... that you'll forget what I did back there.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.300
That would make me feel much better.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.220
That's impossible.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:34.010
I'm sure everyone thinks you manipulated that beast using magic from the Mist People.

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:39.040
Do you think so as well?

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.580
I don't have enough references to make a judgment.

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:51.450
But if you have the power to use magic, then I wouldn't be worried over it.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:53.900
Why not?

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:57.140
The good nature of both magic and physical strength depends on those who wield it.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:11.120
Once the wound heals, I'm sure you'll
be able to move your arm again.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:12.760
I'm sorry.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:15.670
Why are you apologizing?

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:28.480
You've saved this life of mine, but I'm afraid it won't last for much longer.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:32.450
None of their wounds are placing their lives at risk.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.560
Yours, neither.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.410
I'm not talking about the wounds.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:42.240
The trunk supporting this country won't last any longer.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:49.130
I've seen quite plainly that there's nothing we can do about it.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:58.900
I'm not saying this because the Grand Duke has lost his loyalty to the Queen and raided us with his army.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:08.840
I think what has really protected this country is not we Sezan nor the Grand Duke's army,

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:18.500
but the citizens' hearts which adore the Queen's pure intentions of detesting war.

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:27.220
The reason why this country didn't become an aggressor and march into other countries despite having the strength of Touda

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:32.350
is because the Queen truly detests war.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:39.970
And, as for the Wajyaku and Holon who have forgotten about that, they will perish.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:47.600
We 43 Sezans are nothing more than a rampart made of straw.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.020
Wajyaku and Holon...

00:18:58.880 --> 00:18:59.570
That's not it.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.460
What's not?

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:07.060
Those Touda were not from the Grand Duke's army.

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:08.250
What?

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:14.170
How?  How can you say that so confidently?

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:22.100
If it had been a Touda from the Grand Duke's quarter, you would find a crest on the Touda's tail that indicates which village it was raised in.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:24.600
Those Touda did not have that.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:36.410
If that story is true, then how do you know about this crest that not even we know of?

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:43.680
I was...

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:48.120
raised in a Touda breeders' village.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.770
My mother was of the Mist People.

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:56.440
All the while, she was a beastinarian for Touda, too.

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:08.620
Erin shared with Ial about the village she was raised in,

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:13.270
how her mother was put upon a Touda Trial and died,

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:18.180
and how she drifted to the Queen's quarter after that.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:26.270
Leaving out the details of her mother controlling the Touda, she revealed everything else.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:36.930
No, I wasn't laughing at your story.

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:38.670
I'm just being strange today.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:44.100
I've told you many things that I shouldn't have.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:48.070
I only thought maybe it was the same with you.

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:50.600
I may have.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.520
Please rest as much as possible.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:13.480
I'm sure there are many things you can still protect with your right arm.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.300
You're right.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:23.090
If what you told me is true, I will have to rethink this case from the start.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:23.890
Also,

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:29.390
I will not speak of your mother to anyone.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.390
I promise you.

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:35.380
But if you find it necessary, please talk about it.

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:47.630
She lost her mother right before her own eyes...

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:14.550
While he considered the conspiracy behind this country,

00:22:14.550 --> 00:22:19.180
Ial couldn't stop thinking about Erin,

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:21.970
who would probably be pulled into this war.

00:24:01.950 --> 00:24:10.890
Since I saved the Queen, I was ordered to protect the Queen's journey back with Lilan.

00:24:10.890 --> 00:24:16.520
Once Lilan goes to the capital, I'm sure she won't be allowed to live like a beast-lord anymore.

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:21.070
To avoid that, I must reveal the entire story.

00:24:21.070 --> 00:24:24.860
Kemono no Souja Erin.  The Truth About the Queen.

00:24:24.970 --> 00:25:59.990
The Truth About the Queen
